                        "entry_id": "b318719d-7d5b-30e4-a99d-77757b6b3362",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Appetitlosigkeit, Mangel an Appetit (besonders als Anzeichen einer Krankheit oder Störung); Anorexie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d4986da-a88e-4046-a67b-0317dde7f9f3",
                                "sense_id": "5a453a3e-7af6-3158-a0b9-a4f125738fbc",
                                "text": "Appendicitis is a life-threatening disorder in which a […] shift in pain is preceded by anorexia and nausea and is accompanied by fever, occasional vomiting, abdominal tenderness […]"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2836b3f-2a56-3336-8540-90fd6b136810",
                        "entry_id": "b318719d-7d5b-30e4-a99d-77757b6b3362",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Anorexia nervosa (psychische Störung, bei der Kranken das Essen ablehnen)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "technisch nicht korrekt"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0d6150c-d9a3-45bd-b80c-e238b7b4f7e9",
                                "sense_id": "f2836b3f-2a56-3336-8540-90fd6b136810",
                                "text": "There is no “normal” recovery time from anorexia or bulimia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26fa168a-94a3-404a-af80-dc27d328c708",
                                "sense_id": "f2836b3f-2a56-3336-8540-90fd6b136810",
                                "text": "What do I look like? Well, I'm tall (176 cm) and I think I'm overweight, although everyone else says I'm just being anorexic. Wish I did have anorexia sometimes (though I've seen a few girls with it, and it's pretty off)."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
